1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,898
Set up your profile once. Every application after this uses it.

2
00:00:05,198 --> 00:00:07,946
Open the menu, then Account Settings.

3
00:00:08,246 --> 00:00:13,357
Add your details. Name, phone, address, date of birth.

4
00:00:13,657 --> 00:00:15,076
Attach your résumé.

5
00:00:15,376 --> 00:00:17,949
That is the file it attaches for you later.

6
00:00:18,249 --> 00:00:22,535
No signature? It draws one from your name. Pick a style.

7
00:00:22,835 --> 00:00:26,362
Save. Done. You will not type any of this again.

8
00:00:26,662 --> 00:00:29,426
Next. Generate your résumé with AI.

